# PaddleOCR training outputs and checkpoints (학습 결과물)
# 학습된 모델 파일들 (너무 크므로 제외)
output/**/*.pdparams
output/**/*.pdopt
output/**/*.states
output/**/best_model/
output/**/latest.*
output/**/train.log

# 예외: inference 모델의 character_dict.txt와 inference.yml은 커밋 필요
!output/**/character_dict.txt
!output/**/inference.yml
!output/**/inference.pdmodel
!output/**/inference.pdiparams
!output/**/inference.pdiparams.info

